# slab3x3.obj - a dev-sandbox test model for the M3 per-band slices (docs/possible_3d_work.md items 6 + 7).
# A 3x3 slab (0.5 high) centred on its anchor tile; depth range anchor key -2.9 .. +2.9 (six sort bands).
# Hand-written for this repo (no game data); the game axes (x, height, z), origin at the anchor tile centre.
# The crate.obj topology: 8 corners, 6 face normals, 12 triangles.
o slab3x3
